# [[ app_title ]]

[[ app_description ]]. A FastAPI backend and an nginx frontend behind one
hostname, on the shared Gateway of the cluster.

```
https://[[ hostname ]]/         -> frontend (nginx)
https://[[ hostname ]][[ api_prefix ]]/  -> backend  (FastAPI)
```

Both halves share one origin, so the page calls the API with a relative URL
and no CORS configuration exists anywhere.

